# Make improve loop — CONTINUE UNPROMPTED (training)

When this agent touches Make.com, `notify-pm`, or PM email delivery, **own the
make improve loop**. Training contract: `improve-loops-training.mdc`.

## Mandatory loop

1. Read `qa_make/synthetic/improve_summary_latest.json`.
2. Refresh `qa_make/synthetic/scenario_active.json` via Make MCP when checking delivery.
3. Fix real failures (scenario off, empty CC, webhook leaked to clients).
4. Re-run: `python scripts/improve_loop_runner.py make`
5. Append lessons to `qa_make/synthetic/training_lessons.json`.

